<title>DENMARK: Danish KommuneKredit raises four pct 1999 bond.</title>
<headline>Danish KommuneKredit raises four pct 1999 bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's KommuneKredit raised an existing four percent bond due 1999 by 40 million crowns to 300 million crowns, arranger Gudme Raaschou said in a statement distributed by Copenhagen Stock Exchange on Monday. --Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
